   Technol HOME Program; Malardalen Univ, Future Energy Profile},
Abstract = {Driven by Chinese government, China's natural gas power generation
   industry has to deal with the energy price's reformation, the price of
   natural gas, electric power and some other energy source will be made by
   market instead of government. In recent years, China's natural gas power
   generation industry has made an unprecedented progress in the
   development of improving the energy structure and promoting Green
   Economy greatly. By establishing the cost estimation model of natural
   gas power generation and using the method of analysis for sensitivity
   factor, we think that the prime cost of natural gas is high in aspect of
   energy source cost. However, from the point of view of carbon emission
   cost, the cost of natural gas power generation is lower than coal power
   generation. On the other side such as power generation equipment, most
   of constant costs has been spent on imported power generation equipment.
   Therefore, Chinese natural gas power generation industries should work
   together with the China government for reducing the price of natural
   gas, realizing the gas turbine home-made, establishing the natural gas
   storage system and finally stabilizing natural gas supply.(C) 2016 The
