   Inst Architects; Hong Kong Institut Engineers; Hong Kong Inst Surveyors;
   HKSTS; IUE; JSCE; RICS; Urban Planning Soc China; China Civil Engn Soc},
Abstract = {Open excavation sections of Shanghai Bund tunnel project are adjacent to
   the style building groups of Shanghai Bund. Deformation control of deep
   excavation projects and the influence on the surrounding environment are
   directly related to the use and security of the style building groups.
   The deep excavation projects of Shanghai Bund tunnel used the support
   system of diaphragm wall. A series of measures had been taken that the
   large foundation pit would be divided into small one with sealing wall
   and mixing pile wall, the insertion ratio of the diaphragm wall was
   improved, tri-axial mixing pile was applied for pre-consolidation both
   sides of the soil body on slot wall and within the pit combined with
   precipitation. So the deformation of foundation pit was effectively
   controlled. The ground subsidence and deformation of surrounding
   buildings were reduced. The protective standards of the deep excavation
   construction are determined by professional testing and evaluation of
   the style building groups. The entire process of the construction was
   monitored and the monitoring data was analyzed in the information
   construction. A scientific basis is provided to establish and implement
   the protective measures of the style building groups around the deep
   excavation.},
