   Ukraine; Bulgarian Ind Assoc},
Abstract = {The paper presents the structure of an interactive web platform for
   water integrated management, accessible on Internet. The users of the
   web platform have unlimited access at a lot of interest information from
   water integrated management, like: legislation in domain, diverse types
   of management systems, links to the others speciality sites, a
   discussion forum, cases studies, presentation of technologies for
   solving of the management water problems, etc. Through the web
   technological platform, the visitors / users can also view communication
   and education activities which represent the key elements of formulation
   of politics from water domain. Others advantages of the web integrated
   platform consist in offering consulting, technical assistance services,
   implementing of new technologies. The integrated web platform has as
   object satisfy of human necessities, from this reason it is reflected
   the society perception, the platform constitutes an echo of the projects
   and programs in water domain. Through the web platform, will be assured
   the necessary means, so the governmental agencies and others
   institutions to met or establish partnerships between them and the
   public.},
