   Handling of Loads and Repetitive Movements in Deburring Tasks in a
   Warehouse in the Cities of Cali, Armenia and Barranquilla in Colombia},
Booktitle = {PROCEEDINGS OF THE 22ND CONGRESS OF THE INTERNATIONAL ERGONOMICS
   ASSOCIATION, VOL 5, IEA 2024},
