Abstract = {As accidents tend to be multicausal, the interpretation of accident data
   can be a fairly complex task. Hence it is worth experimenting with
   innovative procedures in order to extrapolate patterns within such data
   Accordingly, records of motorway accidents in northern Italy, stored on
