   Water Resources Assoc; Korean Soc Water \& Waste Water; Korean Soc Agr
   Engn},
Abstract = {To predict the behavior of biological wastewater treatment plants,
   biokinetic parameters must be known. The procedures are presented to
   estimate bio-kinetic parameters for heterotrophic biomass. Respirometric
   analysis in the batch reactor was carried out for the experimental
   assessment of kinetic parameters. To estimate bio-kinetic parameters of
   heterotrophic biomass, the simple batch tests under aerobic condition
   were used. In the batch tests, nitrification inhibitor(thiourea) is
   added to inactivate autotrophic biomass. Maximum specific growth rate,
   yield coefficient, half-saturation constant, decay rate and active
   fraction of heterotrophic biomass were obtained measuring OUR. The aim
   of this paper is to estimate the kinetic parameters of heterotrophic
   biomass using the respirometric analysis in the batch reactor.},
