Abstract = {With the rapid development of service industry, service quality has
   attracted extensive attention service enterprises, experts and scholars.
   How to establish competitive advantage of enterprise itself in the
   service market has become an important topic in the service sector. One
   of the important strategies is to make the customer have a good service
   quality perception in the process of receiving services. As a new
   industry, exhibition industry has keeping a rapid development, but many
   problems exist during the development of the industry, especially
   referring to service quality. Thus, this study attempts to indentify the
   satisfaction to the service quality of professional audience by a survey
   from a practical exhibition based on the theory of service quality. The
   author conducts a questionnaire survey on professional audience of the
   East China fair in Shanghai. There were 31 indicators based on the
   United States model of customer satisfaction index (ACSI) for an
   evaluation system and the survey data is analyzed by SPSS software. This
   research may contribute to the exhibition organizers improve customer
   satisfaction and effectively stimulate the enthusiasm of visitors
   continue to take part in exhibition, so as to promote the development of
   exhibition economy.},
